                <pb facs="0367" n="357" sameAs="frus:frus1941v06/pg357"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.796/223: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-30T23:00:00-05:00">December 30, 1941—11
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1166. Your 1565, December 27, 3 p.m. As Air France is on Proclaimed List, you
                    should instruct Intava not to furnish the gasoline and anti-corrosive fluid or
                    any other supplies to Air France.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
